# Starter CODEOWNERS template.
#
# Copy this file to `.github/CODEOWNERS` in your repository and edit
# the teams/usernames for your project. CODEOWNERS is per-repo — it
# does NOT propagate from this `.github` repo automatically.
#
# Replace the placeholder teams below with real GitHub teams under the
# sas-technology org (an org owner needs to create them first — see
# this repo's PR description / ORG_SETTINGS.md for the list this repo
# assumes exists).
#
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default owner for anything not matched below.
* @sas-technology/maintainers

# CI/CD and workflow changes should get an extra set of eyes.
/.github/ @sas-technology/maintainers

# Call out anything security- or data-sensitive explicitly.
/src/auth/ @sas-technology/security
/src/**/student-data/ @sas-technology/security

# Docs can usually be reviewed by a wider group.
*.md @sas-technology/maintainers
/docs/ @sas-technology/maintainers
